notes.content:
Dear players,
Hello!
After fully considering your comments and opinions collected from various platforms, we have released the latest major version update today, which is as follows:

Note: The new version requires a new game overlay and deletion of the old save to ensure that the updated content can be effective.
1, adjust part of the light and light source, to improve the atmosphere of the environment and atmosphere foil;
2. Made clear level segmentation for the large indoor process of the third level, and added the facilities with the transmission function in accordance with the setting in some areas to ensure the linear experience of people on the path and collection;
3. Adjusted the expression ways and ai logic of some monsters, strengthened the sense of oppression of monsters and the operation experience of playing games with monsters;
4. New text and voice contents are added to ensure that the plot can be presented in a more perfect form;
5. Fixed known bugs and made further optimizations to ensure stable and reasonable operation of the game.

Due to lack of online experience and some commercial reasons, our production team neglected the evaluation of the online version of the game, which brought a lot of bad experience to everyone. We are really sorry and sad about this. We didn't want our game to be buried in the dust with the wind of evil, so we focused on the current version based on everyone's suggestions, hoping to finish a fun game and bring you a great experience again.

The entire production team would like to thank everyone who has followed us since the launch for their tolerance and support, as well as every constructive comment that has helped us go further. If there is a chance, we will bring you an incomparable experience with better works in the future.
